{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the area of the triangle with vertices of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be593b1f2eee475dc53373fd9dda5604bce2e40c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b6a364920ec84c82c57831adffe0e2ad2b9be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/b/1bb913ad463dcc2916d4135977f0d06f20ad93cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be593b1f2eee475dc53373fd9dda5604bce2e40c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> are collinear, let that be the base. It therefore has length 8. The distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/b/c4b6a364920ec84c82c57831adffe0e2ad2b9be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> to this line is the same as the distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b140eff6338916ca72f19c0b695e806cb666de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77f46e8ad13e4a3e569bb6c47d1d642243a3119d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, which is equal to 4. The area of this triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321380ecfe48f77f040a767a5627fbc7ae9f9dd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8\\cdot4}{2}=\\boxed{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are asked: Find the area of the triangle with vertices\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/8/b687f9dd22c2edfe50c41f4f37d0c625fe4b0fa4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[A = (1,2), \\quad B = (1,10), \\quad C = (5,5)\\]\" width=\"293\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 1: Determinant formula**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/1/151edaa2080ab79a89d3727dd1832d92c26597ce.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Area} = \\frac{1}{2}  \\left| \\begin{matrix}  x_1 &amp; y_1 &amp; 1 \\\\  x_2 &amp; y_2 &amp; 1 \\\\  x_3 &amp; y_3 &amp; 1  \\end{matrix}  \\right|\\]\" width=\"160\" height=\"65\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 2: Plug in coordinates**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/8/5580c0b15208c1f961db3d356d30b187980b202f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Area} = \\frac{1}{2}  \\left| \\begin{matrix}  1 &amp; 2 &amp; 1 \\\\  1 &amp; 10 &amp; 1 \\\\  5 &amp; 5 &amp; 1  \\end{matrix}  \\right|\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"65\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 3: Expand the determinant**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fcde40afed0518ef3cd08597bbdec566f6ebaa0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{matrix} 1 \\cdot (10 \\cdot 1 - 1 \\cdot 5) \\\\ - 2 \\cdot (1 \\cdot 1 - 1 \\cdot 5) \\\\ + 1 \\cdot (1 \\cdot 5 - 10 \\cdot 5) \\end{matrix}\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"58\" />\n</p><p>Compute each term:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/1/221ca10429e506c53ce67c44d5f29c2a8db5194b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 \\cdot (10 - 5) = 5\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/2/142016efd1e2238bbec0cff9d4f78bf57c54d8a0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-2 \\cdot (1 - 5) = 8\\]\" width=\"122\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfe74f94472fd82063ee128225a2c5ea524e65bd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1 \\cdot (5 - 50) = -45\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Sum:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/2/ec2cafb397e3379013d937aad1c571a16a1c8681.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[5 + 8 - 45 = -32\\]\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Step 4: Area formula**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/0/660411e59470678494bf8b1b33a5a9a691b01862.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Area} = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot | -32 | = 16\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>---\n</p>\n<ul><li><ul><li>Answer:**</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/2/8f245366a02a2a2112a1e2f1cbc250693d1a6216.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Area} = 16\\]\" width=\"76\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"5